title: Payments
description: Charges cards and reconciles payouts.
connects:
  - to: services/ledger          # a path from the repository root
    label: gRPC
    description: |
      Posts a journal entry for every settled charge.

      The call is `Ledger.Post`, and it is idempotent on the charge id, so a retry never books a charge twice.
  - to: services/notifications
    label: events
  - to: services/nowhere
    label: lost
ignore:
  - fixtures
